<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA'S TALLINNA PANK PROFIT UP IN 1996.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA'S TALLINNA PANK PROFIT UP IN 1996.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tallinna Pank, Estonia's fourth largest bank, said on Monday that its 1996 consolidated profit was 50.4 million kroons versus 33.1 million kroons in 1995.</p>
<p>&quot;The group's gross profit grew faster than the company's net profit...it grew by 67.7 percent to reqach 56 million kroons,&quot; the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>--David Mardiste, Tallinn newsroom +372 630 8400</p>
</text>
